<https://seeds.local/item/sd-non.2> <https://seeds.local/ontology/closeReason> "Every write's --json now carries tx (create/update/close/comments add; label/reopen/defer/dep already did); a CLI test pins each write's tx and reads it back with --at. scbrown/seeds#16 (aegis-w3k75d.8)." .
